title: "Smart POCT Dot-Blot Reader for Toxoplasmosis: AI-Enabled Detection of Anti-GRA7 Antibodies"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24124978
authors:
