    affiliation: "Department of Electrical Engineering, Politeknik Negeri Malang, Malang, Indonesia; Doctoral Program in Medical Science and ATOM Research Group, Faculty of Medicine, Universitas Brawijaya, Malang, Indonesia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/doditsuprianto/Smart-POCT-Dot-Blot-Reader-for-Toxoplasmosis-AI-Enabled-Detection-of-Anti-GRA7-Antibodies"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, data, trained models and results for an AI-enabled point-of-care reader of anti-GRA7 antigen-capture dot-blot
  assays for Toxoplasma gondii serodiagnosis: YOLOv8n-seg spot detection, artefact-controlled quantification of grayscale
  spot crops, machine-learning and CNN classifiers, and a desktop diagnosis application. Research prototype, not a
  validated medical device. Data and figures are released under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
keywords:
  - toxoplasmosis
  - Toxoplasma gondii
  - GRA7
  - dot-blot
  - point-of-care testing
  - serodiagnosis
  - image segmentation
  - YOLOv8
  - machine learning
  - convolutional neural network
